          "comment": "[Playbook] Section 8.2 binds Ono to an open-ended non-compete with no performance-based exit, so we capped Ono's side at twelve (12) months and made it end automatically if Array misses service levels or delivery dates. Array's reciprocal covenant is untouched, and we conformed Array's termination trigger to the capped covenant.",
