              "text": "The obligations of Ono and its Affiliates under this Section 8.2 shall in no event continue beyond the twelve (12) month anniversary of the Effective Date, and shall terminate automatically if Array fails to meet the service levels or delivery dates under any supply agreement between the Parties."
